WEBVTT

00:01.130 --> 00:03.360
Bastard, who are you?

00:07.640 --> 00:10.470
I know who the Joker is!

00:10.470 --> 00:12.270
This flower...

00:17.750 --> 00:21.510
I have decided that I will seize hold of
a new life with my own hands!

00:23.820 --> 00:31.560
We've all surely got our arms outstretched

00:31.560 --> 00:38.520
Towards a far, faraway place

00:51.880 --> 00:58.090
Blown by the wind, we walk on

00:58.090 --> 01:05.050
Wanting to know the reason we were born

01:05.260 --> 01:11.570
Even if a time of loss should come

01:11.570 --> 01:18.700
Let's now choose to hold each other tight

01:21.140 --> 01:28.550
We've all surely got our arms outstretched

01:28.550 --> 01:34.520
Towards something we can't lose

01:34.520 --> 01:42.160
Pulling only brilliant dreams closer

01:42.160 --> 01:49.040
Towards a far, faraway place

01:57.150 --> 02:01.100
Episode 9
After the Battle

02:03.750 --> 02:05.920
Is it a shock?

02:05.920 --> 02:10.980
It would be wasted in your hands anyway.

02:17.900 --> 02:19.800
Okay, move out!

02:19.800 --> 02:25.740
All the Templans have been rendered helpless
by the poison of the Gai roses!

02:25.740 --> 02:27.840
Launch an all-out assault!

02:27.840 --> 02:29.240
Dumas!

02:29.240 --> 02:31.650
You would never understand.

02:31.650 --> 02:36.740
Climbing to the rank of shard champion brought
me nothing but a worthless "honor".

02:37.920 --> 02:42.660
How I despise this mark of slavery
that I bear on my own body.

02:42.660 --> 02:44.720
It's the symbol of my clan.

02:45.690 --> 02:50.830
But if I can alter this fate, then
I don't care what it takes!

02:50.830 --> 02:53.840
Is that what you deceived us for?

02:53.840 --> 02:57.030
Everyone in Templar... and me?

02:59.540 --> 03:01.170
Do it!

03:20.800 --> 03:23.760
What is this? What's going on?

03:27.100 --> 03:29.000
What in the world...

03:29.000 --> 03:30.800
Lord Khan!

03:32.170 --> 03:33.840
Lord Khan...

03:33.840 --> 03:35.280
What is it?

03:35.280 --> 03:39.210
Zymotan forces have appeared
all around the castle.

03:39.210 --> 03:43.210
Our troops aren't able to move freely...

03:45.490 --> 03:47.450
Hey! Hang on!

03:48.990 --> 03:51.960
Those are the symptoms of Gai rose poisoning!

04:00.700 --> 04:02.500
What is going on here?

04:02.500 --> 04:04.470
Why won't it obey me?!

04:25.160 --> 04:26.830
Get Princess Rebecca out of here quickly!

04:26.830 --> 04:28.460
Hurry!

04:31.300 --> 04:33.100
Elda?

04:33.100 --> 04:36.500
It's okay, I'll be right after you.

04:41.410 --> 04:43.340
Don't let them get away!
After them!

04:43.340 --> 04:45.310
Are you done, Elda?!

05:05.730 --> 05:07.360
That's...

06:08.530 --> 06:10.160
You...

06:10.800 --> 06:12.430
Why?

06:15.770 --> 06:17.770
Ridiculous...

06:17.770 --> 06:20.840
You're a spirit that I released.

06:20.840 --> 06:22.810
Why don't you obey me?!

06:56.240 --> 06:58.470
It's a useless spirit.

07:21.670 --> 07:23.470
Where am I?

07:33.750 --> 07:36.110
What gives you the nerve to come back here?

07:36.980 --> 07:39.220
L..Lord Glaudio!

07:39.220 --> 07:43.020
Pathetic, you worthless dogs can die!

08:05.410 --> 08:07.250
That's...

08:07.250 --> 08:09.050
Amir Gaul!

08:26.200 --> 08:28.570
What is it doing in a place like this?

08:30.170 --> 08:32.260
Damn it, no!

08:37.210 --> 08:38.840
Dumas!

08:41.020 --> 08:42.810
The bastard...

09:13.350 --> 09:15.470
Looks like your operation is a failure.

09:19.490 --> 09:21.460
Time to pay the piper.

09:21.990 --> 09:23.990
Wait.

09:23.990 --> 09:26.530
You did what you were supposed to.

09:26.530 --> 09:28.500
You are not at fault.

09:47.480 --> 09:53.220
I knew from the very start that
Dumas was the Joker.

09:54.120 --> 09:58.690
So, now that you have given me
the full traitor treatment,

09:58.690 --> 10:00.850
I can't help but wonder what
business brings you here.

10:02.300 --> 10:05.770
Oh, I see! You want to apologize.

10:05.770 --> 10:09.370
This does not change the fact
that you are No-Face.

10:09.370 --> 10:13.140
So, that's your way of glossing over
the mistake you've all made?

10:13.940 --> 10:17.080
You are to be released under certain conditions.

10:17.080 --> 10:18.080
Oh?

10:18.080 --> 10:23.180
Dumas must be brought back
from Zymot at once.

10:23.180 --> 10:27.390
Would you care to go into Zymot as leader of
the party we have set to that task?

10:27.390 --> 10:30.120
Those would be the conditions
for my release, I take it?

10:32.560 --> 10:33.960
How interesting.

10:33.960 --> 10:36.930
It may just be a chance for me to
relieve some of this anger.

10:43.340 --> 10:50.180
Zed, your spirit played a huge role in
combating the enemy invasion.

10:50.180 --> 10:54.620
However, its power also caused great
damage to our own forces.

10:54.620 --> 10:58.090
That is to say, your spirit did little
more than go on a rampage.

10:58.090 --> 11:01.460
Its power is great, but also dangerous!

11:01.460 --> 11:02.460
And?

11:02.460 --> 11:04.490
Listen carefully, Zed.

11:04.490 --> 11:08.630
We have tolerated your conduct so far.

11:08.630 --> 11:12.830
However, we are unable to determine the
damage that its uncontrollable powers

11:12.830 --> 11:14.960
might wreak upon Templar.

11:16.000 --> 11:19.370
Tell me, who are you?

11:22.880 --> 11:24.480
Answer him, Zed!

11:24.480 --> 11:26.710
You are just an outsider after all.

11:26.710 --> 11:29.250
We could apprehend you as a
subversive, you know!

11:29.250 --> 11:30.650
Shut up!

11:30.650 --> 11:33.120
Just leave me alone!

11:40.660 --> 11:43.930
Hey, I'm asking you what happened.

11:44.770 --> 11:46.670
Nothing, all right?

11:46.670 --> 11:48.860
More importantly, what happened to Mickey?

11:50.040 --> 11:52.010
He's pretty down about things.

11:52.870 --> 11:54.500
Oh...

11:59.580 --> 12:01.210
Oh, no!

12:06.750 --> 12:08.720
Hey, are you all right?

12:08.720 --> 12:10.690
Hang in there!

12:10.690 --> 12:12.660
She's really weak.

12:18.930 --> 12:23.440
In any case, you can stay in this
house until you've recovered.

12:23.440 --> 12:25.410
If there's anything you need,
don't hesitate to ask, okay?

12:45.990 --> 12:47.620
Teacher...

12:52.030 --> 12:54.300
Poor Mickey...

12:54.300 --> 12:56.240
That son of a bitch Dumas...

12:56.240 --> 12:57.810
I can't forgive him.

12:57.810 --> 12:59.040
That reminds me...

12:59.040 --> 13:03.100
I heard that Master Robès will be leading
a punitive force after Dumas.

13:04.040 --> 13:05.380
Are you serious?

13:05.380 --> 13:07.710
Yeah, that's the word around town.

13:09.180 --> 13:10.980
Wait, Zed!

13:15.460 --> 13:17.080
Zed...

13:21.760 --> 13:24.330
Even if we do send in a punitive force,

13:24.330 --> 13:28.270
we don't know how they'll perform
in unfamiliar territory.

13:28.270 --> 13:31.270
Your destination is Zymot, in any case.

13:31.270 --> 13:33.840
It's no different than going into Hell itself.

13:33.840 --> 13:36.180
We'll need someone to serve as a guide.

13:36.180 --> 13:37.800
Robès!

13:42.380 --> 13:45.580
Sending someone so inexperienced is
obviously out of the question!

13:46.390 --> 13:47.760
Why the hell not?

13:47.760 --> 13:51.060
If you're there, you'll only be
a hindrance to the others!

13:51.060 --> 13:52.390
Get out of here now!

13:52.390 --> 13:53.660
What?!

13:53.660 --> 13:55.060
Easy now...

13:55.060 --> 13:57.970
If he really wants to go that badly,
I don't mind bringing him.

13:57.970 --> 13:58.970
Really?

13:58.970 --> 14:00.730
Wait, Robès...

14:00.730 --> 14:04.870
But only after he's captured the Zymotan
troops who failed to escape

14:04.870 --> 14:07.040
and brought them back here.

14:07.040 --> 14:08.410
You mean it, right?

14:08.410 --> 14:10.040
I do.

14:11.850 --> 14:13.880
What do you think you're doing, Robès?

14:13.880 --> 14:17.620
If you don't give him something,
there's no end to his whining.

14:17.620 --> 14:20.280
If he does bring them back, I'll just pretend
I don't know what he's talking about.

14:31.100 --> 14:32.900
I'm coming in.

14:34.440 --> 14:37.700
Well, I don't know if this will
be to your liking, but...

14:38.840 --> 14:40.810
Just get better soon, okay?

14:59.090 --> 15:01.060
If I could just get my legs healed...

15:02.630 --> 15:04.530
Take these, Elda.

15:04.530 --> 15:07.130
This is all I can give you for now.

15:07.130 --> 15:10.100
Bring Princess Rebecca back,
no matter what it takes.

15:11.240 --> 15:12.870
I will.

15:30.260 --> 15:33.160
Say, how's that girl doing?

15:34.030 --> 15:37.830
She won't say a single thing no matter what I do.

15:37.830 --> 15:40.990
She didn't even touch the food I made her either.

15:42.040 --> 15:44.030
I wonder what her problem is?

15:45.940 --> 15:48.110
Eat it; it'll go to waste otherwise.

15:48.110 --> 15:50.580
Eat it and get your ass up and about.

15:57.250 --> 15:59.580
Why the heck does she listen to Zed?

16:03.460 --> 16:05.860
There they are! Don't let them escape!

16:05.860 --> 16:08.090
That way! After them!

16:08.830 --> 16:10.530
Whoa, where are you going?!

16:10.530 --> 16:12.160
Hey!

16:23.210 --> 16:25.010
That way?

16:33.650 --> 16:35.450
A Zymotan soldier...

16:58.350 --> 17:00.680
That spirit... I see.

17:02.980 --> 17:04.950
I will not let things remain this way.

17:06.620 --> 17:08.360
For my father's sake, too...

17:08.360 --> 17:10.520
I swear I will reconstruct the kingdom.

17:26.840 --> 17:28.970
Butting in like that...

17:32.880 --> 17:34.910
Who the heck did that?

17:51.570 --> 17:54.130
What do you think you're doing?!

17:54.130 --> 17:56.360
I was trying to heal your wound.

17:57.600 --> 18:00.570
Do you really need to be worrying about
other people at this point?

18:01.340 --> 18:03.310
Get to sleep.

18:03.310 --> 18:06.010
Actually, I have a favor to ask of you!

18:07.250 --> 18:08.780
Lend me...

18:08.780 --> 18:10.910
Lend me your strength, please!

18:11.690 --> 18:13.880
Huh? Me?

18:17.020 --> 18:20.360
Can I get you to come along quietly
with me, young lady?

18:20.360 --> 18:22.100
What do you want, Robès?

18:22.100 --> 18:25.800
Well, you see, that girl is from Zymot.

18:25.800 --> 18:27.330
Zymot?!

18:27.330 --> 18:29.800
Take a good look at her right hand!

18:34.910 --> 18:36.710
This is...

18:39.480 --> 18:43.120
The sign on her hand is proof that she
is a member of their royal family.

18:43.120 --> 18:49.020
But I heard that all members of the royal family
had been executed by the current regime.

18:49.020 --> 18:51.680
I am the only one who remains.

18:52.060 --> 18:55.230
Why have you come to Templar?

18:55.230 --> 19:00.270
I don't suppose you've switched sides and
participated in their recent invasion?

19:00.270 --> 19:01.270
No!

19:01.270 --> 19:04.610
I will never join forces with the current regime!

19:04.610 --> 19:06.710
Then what is your aim?

19:06.710 --> 19:08.330
Speak!

19:10.910 --> 19:12.050
Actually,

19:12.050 --> 19:17.780
Robès has expressed that he would like to have
her serve as his party's guide into Zymot.

19:17.780 --> 19:19.120
It's too dangerous.

19:19.120 --> 19:20.820
She is, after all, an outsider.

19:20.820 --> 19:23.660
We have no idea what she might do.

19:23.660 --> 19:25.030
Indeed!

19:25.030 --> 19:29.160
The fact she is Zymotan makes
her all the more suspect!

19:29.160 --> 19:31.790
It's okay to let her do that much at least, isn't it?

19:32.400 --> 19:37.470
Zed, what exactly were you doing with the girl?

19:37.470 --> 19:39.470
That's none of your damn business.

19:39.470 --> 19:41.940
Mind your tongue, Zed!

19:41.940 --> 19:44.680
We know neither this girl's objectives,

19:44.680 --> 19:46.780
nor Zed's connection with her.

19:46.780 --> 19:52.220
We cannot allow either to go free
until the facts are clear.

19:57.590 --> 20:00.030
Damn, what a load of bull!

20:00.790 --> 20:03.860
Why did you stick up for me?

20:03.860 --> 20:06.330
I wasn't sticking up for you.

20:07.830 --> 20:12.210
I must return to Zymot,

20:12.210 --> 20:17.610
in order to fight the traitors who deceived
me and usurped the throne!

20:18.780 --> 20:21.350
Please lend me your strength!

20:21.350 --> 20:23.920
Sorry, I am not interested.

20:23.920 --> 20:28.890
There's a guy who ran off into Zymot
that I've got to pay back.

20:28.890 --> 20:32.090
Then, I will bring you to Zymot.

20:33.430 --> 20:36.100
For now, we must break out of here.

20:36.100 --> 20:37.200
What do you plan to do?

20:37.200 --> 20:40.570
I will summon my spirit, who is outside right now.

20:40.570 --> 20:42.770
My spirit's name is Ariel.

20:42.770 --> 20:45.260
I can manipulate her from afar.

20:53.580 --> 20:55.620
This is...

20:55.620 --> 20:56.820
...the one from before!

20:56.820 --> 20:58.790
So, that was you?

21:01.960 --> 21:03.660
Zed, too?

21:03.660 --> 21:07.150
As long as he won't answer our questions, I do
not see him being released anytime soon.

21:08.000 --> 21:09.360
No...

21:09.360 --> 21:11.800
The boy is hopeless.

21:11.800 --> 21:12.970
What should I do?

21:12.970 --> 21:14.760
It's my fault...

21:19.740 --> 21:21.710
Come, let's go!

21:22.410 --> 21:23.410
What's going on?

21:23.410 --> 21:24.480
They're getting away!

21:24.480 --> 21:26.110
That way!
After them!

21:27.850 --> 21:29.480
Hurry!

21:30.880 --> 21:31.120
Zed?

21:31.120 --> 21:32.590
Get them!
Zed?

21:35.390 --> 21:35.690
There they are!

21:35.690 --> 21:37.160
Get them!
There they are!

21:43.400 --> 21:45.370
There's no escape!

21:49.600 --> 21:50.600
Elda!

21:50.600 --> 21:52.570
Is she your ally?

21:55.180 --> 21:57.970
Let us go, Princess Rebecca.

21:59.250 --> 22:01.580
Come, Zed.

22:01.580 --> 22:04.680
Come with me to Zymot!

22:12.460 --> 22:14.260
No, don't!

22:31.950 --> 22:33.110
Zed...

22:33.110 --> 22:35.080
You mustn't go...

22:50.330 --> 22:54.200
I want to peak inside your heart, and find
out your feelings and expressions

22:54.200 --> 22:58.110
I see you bearing your burden alone, and don't
ask the reason for your twinkling tears

22:58.110 --> 23:01.680
I give you a shout of support without mentioning
them, between the answers I'm looking for

23:01.680 --> 23:05.810
Without obsessing or over thinking,
I feel sunbeams in the future you

23:07.510 --> 23:09.350
It feels nice, very, very much

23:09.350 --> 23:11.150
You and me, we're very, very good

23:11.150 --> 23:15.020
I'd like to be there for you any time

23:15.020 --> 23:16.860
Very, very much, whenever

23:16.860 --> 23:18.690
Very, very good, not changing

23:18.690 --> 23:24.650
We're always blooming full of hope,
with all our might (Oh)

23:30.170 --> 23:32.640
I feel this kindness amidst my doubt

23:33.940 --> 23:36.410
I will always have faith in you at all times

23:37.680 --> 23:41.580
Here in this vast landscape
under the sunny blue sky

23:41.580 --> 23:45.710
We got good feelings, good social standing,
we're good; I want to always be here

23:47.190 --> 23:48.990
It feels nice, very, very much

23:48.990 --> 23:50.820
You and me, we're very, very good

23:50.820 --> 23:54.630
I'd like to be there for you any time

23:54.630 --> 23:56.500
Very, very much, whenever

23:56.500 --> 23:58.370
Very, very good, not changing

23:58.370 --> 24:04.330
We're always blooming full of hope,
with all our might (Oh)

24:15.880 --> 24:19.950
Next Time
The Lonely Princess

24:17.280 --> 24:19.950


Next time, "The Lonely Princess"
